,"active_WyrMeA","active_qXFWVN","active_Rt9gfF","active_AkqnHj"],"name":"The Six Actives","settings":{"eyebrow":"The Six Actives","heading":"Every formula begins with","subheading":"One of these six.","link_text":"VIEW ALL","link_url":"shopify:\/\/pages\/dinacharya","padding_top":60,"padding_bottom":60,"padding_top_mobile":40,"padding_bottom_mobile":40}},"skin_tellig_7iaHqU":{"type":"skin-tellig-","blocks":{"concern_cGkUG9":{"type":"concern","settings":{"concern_name":"Dullness","concern_title":"Dullness, lost luminescence,","concern_titled":"The winter face that won't lift.","concern_desc":"Dullness is rarely a tone problem. It is a circulation problem, a turnover problem, and a barrier problem combining at once. Saffron's crocin regulates melanin without bleaching; the kumkumadi-traditional pairing in our Glow Serum drives microcirculation; rose hydrosol lifts the surface acidity that traps light.","concern_meta":"— Begin with the morning Glow Serum. The face will read brighter within ten days.","stat_1_value":"10d","stat_1_label":"First glow","stat_2_value":"88%","stat_2_label":"Reported lift, week 4","stat_3_value":"230","stat_3_label":"Crocin grade · ISO I","sutra_name":"TEJAS","sutra_subtitle":"The Saffron Duo · Brilliance, restored","sutra_badge":"Recommended Sutra","product_collection":"tejas","product_limit":5,"ritual_btn_label":"Add Full Ritual To Bag","ritual_btn_label_2":"Add Full Ritual To Bag","ritual_total":"$168.00","ritual_quote":"My Skin has never looked better before 8am"}},"concern_UWzgap":{"type":"concern","settings":{"concern_name":"Pigmentation","concern_title":"Hyperpigmentation, melasma,","concern_titled":"the marks after the breakout heals.","concern_desc":"Three actives in three steps: turmeric in the weekly mask interrupts inflammatory pigment formation at the source; bakuchiol overnight normalises cell turnover so the existing pigment surfaces and sheds; saffron daily regulates the tyrosinase pathway that produced the pigment in the first place.","concern_meta":"— Patience. Pigmentation is the longest journey. Weeks 8 to 12 is when the work becomes visible.","stat_1_value":"8w","stat_1_label":"Visible shift","stat_2_value":"76%","stat_2_label":"Pigment reduction, 12w","stat_3_value":"3","stat_3_label":"Actives, layered","sutra_name":"SOUNDARYA","sutra_subtitle":"Bridal Glow Set · Even, lifted, true","sutra_badge":"Recommended Sutra","product_collection":"soundarya","product_limit":3,"ritual_btn_label":"Add Full Ritual To Bag","ritual_btn_label_2":"Add Full Ritual To Bag","ritual_total":"$154.00","ritual_quote":"My Skin has never looked better before 8am"}},"concern_gDaHAc":{"type":"concern","settings":{"concern_name":"Aging","concern_title":"Fine lines, lost firmness, skin","concern_titled":"that needs a retinol alternative.","concern_desc":"Bakuchiol is the answer modern dermatology arrived at after retinol — a meroterpene that achieves equivalent collagen synthesis without the irritation, photosensitivity, or pregnancy contraindication. Layered with saffron's antioxidant load and sesame's lipid stabilisation, the result is firmness without compromise.","concern_meta":"— Bakuchiol is pregnancy-safe. Retinol is not. The intelligence here is in the substitution.","stat_1_value":"12w","stat_1_label":"Collagen-equivalent","stat_2_value":"0","stat_2_label":"Photosensitivity risk","stat_3_value":"99%","stat_3_label":"Bakuchiol purity","sutra_name":"CHIRAYU","sutra_subtitle":"Age Defying Duo · Time, gently","sutra_badge":"Recommended Sutra","product_collection":"chirayu","product_limit":3,"ritual_btn_label":"Add Full Ritual To Bag","ritual_btn_label_2":"Add Full Ritual To Bag","ritual_total":"$178.00","ritual_quote":"My Skin has never looked better before 8am"}},"concern_TjdeHT":{"type":"concern","settings":{"concern_name":"Breakouts","concern_title":"Breakouts, congestion,","concern_titled":"the inflammation that leaves a mark.","concern_desc":"Acne is inflammation before it is anything else. Curcumin 